# QA docs lookup — Q&A vs write-docs

Protokol lengkap: `qa-docs/_meta/README-lookup.md`.

Repo ini: **`qa-docs/` di root** (bukan `docs/qa-docs/`).

## Q&A (jawab pertanyaan) — jangan baca fat manifest dulu

1. Resolve slug lewat **`qa-docs/_meta/alias-index.yaml`** atau **`lookup.tsv`** (grep alias / `menu_name` / route).
2. Buka **`qa-docs/{slug}/README.md`**.
3. Baca **satu layer** sesuai triage (`08`): KB / requirement / technical.
4. Jika baris punya `also` / ada di `collisions` — disambiguasi dari kata user.

Fallback `manifest.yaml` hanya jika lookup tidak ketemu.

## Write-docs (tambah/ubah menu) — tetap manifest-first

1. `qa-docs/_meta/manifest.yaml` = SoT slug (jangan rename).
2. Folder `qa-docs/{slug}/` + template `_meta/templates/`.
3. `python3 qa-docs/_meta/generate-lookup.py` (atau `npm run docs:lookup`) di commit yang sama.
4. Nickname extra / collision → `lookup-overrides.yaml`, bukan mass-edit requirement.

## Q&A jangan baca (kecuali user minta TC/card/flow)

- `test-cases/**`
- `ETM-*/**`
- `_legacy/**`
- `flows/**`
- `_meta/docs-hub/**`, `templates/**`, `gemini-briefs/**`
